{
  "about": "The strings plan 179.1-80 writes, as its checkpoint (Task 1) presents them, each at its recommended answer: every string of the eight adminApp.* catalogue files other than adminApp.login, in fr and lb, which the answer C5 = b at the checkpoint of plan 179.1-70 brought into the round. en is the unchanged source each translation was made from; fr and lb are machine translations. Where the operator’s answer edits a string, plan 80 replaces that value here, word for word, before anything is written, and commits this file alone. 179.1-approved-strings.mjs reads this file together with 179.1-70-approved-strings.json and compares the catalogues with both, per locale and key.",
